Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 12:52:49 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1243/1252] HERESY 1169: the take's tools fill the column:
 Download, Refiner and Files share its width equally, Make again under them (a
 row that grows instead of an auto-fit grid that kept empty tracks)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 08.10.2026: «Сделай растяжку трёх блоков кнопок на всю ширину колонки».

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/console/app.css | 11 +++++++----
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tools/console/app.css b/tools/console/app.css
index aeef027..64839ba 100644
--- a/tools/console/app.css
+++ b/tools/console/app.css
@@ -4451,14 +4451,17 @@ body[data-frame] :is(#view-compose, #view-take) { scrollbar-gutter: stable; }
 /* «Блок с обеими SEEDs… в блок Sampling and Denoising»: the seeds the drawer's first part */
 .seed-sub { margin-bottom: 16px; }
 /* «Секции кнопок под DOWNLOADS, MAKE AGAIN, REFINER определи в собственные обрамлённые приятные в UIX блоки»: each group framed,
-   its name on top; Make again, the largest, a row of its own under the others */
-.take-tools { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr)); gap: 10px; align-items: stretch; }
-.take-tools .tool-group { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; min-width: 0; padding: 9px 11px 11px; border: 1px solid var(--line-a);
+   its name on top; Make again, the largest, a row of its own under the others. HERESY 1169 (Viktor 08.10.2026: «Сделай растяжку
+   трёх блоков кнопок на всю ширину колонки»): a row that grows, not a grid: the grid's auto-fit kept its empty tracks for
+   Make again's span, and the three stood at the left with a gap after them; now they share the column's width equally, and
+   one that wraps in a narrow column takes its row whole */
+.take-tools { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; align-items: stretch; }
+.take-tools .tool-group { flex: 1 1 150px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; min-width: 0; padding: 9px 11px 11px; border: 1px solid var(--line-a);
   border-radius: var(--r-md); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 3%, transparent); }
 .take-tools .tool-group.tg-dl { order: 1; }
 .take-tools .tool-group.tg-refine { order: 2; }
 .take-tools .tool-group.tg-files { order: 3; }
-.take-tools .tool-group.tg-again { order: 4; grid-column: 1 / -1; }
+.take-tools .tool-group.tg-again { order: 4; flex-basis: 100%; }
 .take-tools .tool-cap { display: block; margin: 0; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
 .take-tools .tool-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }
 /* «обрезанный параграф объяснений… нахер там не нужен»: the LoRA picker's notes in a tip beside the LoRAs' name */
-- 
